# Marquee: steps from parity/shell_modules_menubar_Marquee.qml.md (batches 1-5). Screen TESSERA-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Each block runs in both looks: the file runs top to bottom, Material first, then Glass.

look material
ipc timer toggle
wait 1
static pill 880 0 160 30
rec pill 5 ptr move 1500 600
note the time counts down; its width is stable (nothing beside it moves)
ipc timer reset
setup FAKEPLAYER_TRACK="A very long song title that does not fit in the pill at all|Artist" python3 sandbox/tools/fakeplayer.py &
wait 2
rec marquee 8 ptr move 1500 600
note with music.scroll on, the title rests ~1.8 s, scrolls to its end, rests, scrolls back

look glass
ipc timer toggle
wait 1
static pill 880 0 160 30
rec pill 5 ptr move 1500 600
note the time counts down; its width is stable (nothing beside it moves)
ipc timer reset
setup FAKEPLAYER_TRACK="A very long song title that does not fit in the pill at all|Artist" python3 sandbox/tools/fakeplayer.py &
wait 2
rec marquee 8 ptr move 1500 600
note with music.scroll on, the title rests ~1.8 s, scrolls to its end, rests, scrolls back
